==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{PIE root|ru|h₁ed}}
From {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*(j)ěsti}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-bsl-pro|*ēs-ti}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*h₁ed-||to eat}}. Cognates include Ancient Greek {{m|grc|ἔδω}}, {{etyl|la|-}} {{m|la|edō}}, Sanskrit {{m|sa|sc=Deva|अत्ति|tr=átti|}}, Lithuanian {{m|lt|ė́sti||to eat (of animals), to swallow, to gobble}}, Hittite {{m|hit|sc=Xsux|𒂊𒀉𒈪|tr=eidmi||I eat}}, Old English {{m|ang|etan}} (English {{m|en|eat}}).

